lie detector
Now you can check whether your friend is telling you the truth or not on a lie detector. Modern application lie detector, which will allow you to have fun and play pranks on your friends.
The lie detector is a fascinating simulator. It simulates a lie detector with a fingerprint scanner and voice.
How to use?
1.  Ask a question with short yes/no answers;
2. Put your finger on the touchpad;
3. Wait a few seconds;
4. Get a finished result.
Ready to do your first test? 
Download the lie detector app on your smartphone or tablet. Come up with interesting tricky questions for a house party, invite your friends and test them on the lie detector.Your guests will be surprised. Fun and good mood guaranteed!
Game Features:
- Realistic interface, similar to a real lie detector;
- Cool graphics and vivid animation;
- Vibration and sound signal during the scanning process;
- Volume buttons ("+" - truth, "-" - lie);
The simulator is absolutely free, and you don't need to register and start a personal account to start using it. You can start using the lie detector right now and test your friends and family members for honesty.
Attention! The application is released for entertainment purposes. This is a lie detector simulator, so all the answers you get are random and do not correspond to reality.

